# Pointing with the left hand at its own wheel (Akimbo's left stick click), the mirror of wheelpoint.sim: the hand stays where it
# is and only turns, its ray going round the left wheel's eight icons in turn, then settling on one to take into the left hand.
# Run with QUEST_SIM_GIVE of eight weapons or more and QUEST_SIM_LEFT for the left hand's gun.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 shot before
3100 left_click 1
3160 shot open
# The wheel's next page has more of them on it.
3170 left_trigger 1
3176 left_trigger 0
